[about]
Title=07 - Related, Marked, Reports and a Work Search Record
Intro=Following a record to the records that belong to it; marking a few to work with; what look and prime are; getting records out as a report; and a whole task end to end, the work search record a counselor asks for. This walk assumes walks four to six.
Setup=JobTrail is open on the jobs table.
Homework=Mark three jobs, run the Work Search Record report, and read what it made.

[step]

Say=Shift plus R, Say Related: every record linked to this job.
Key=Shift+R
Hear=related, actions (1 record)
Hear=2026-09-08 bar First interview for Accessibility Analyst bar interview scheduled

[step]

Say=Alt plus Right Arrow goes in, the way it goes forward in a browser.
Key=Alt+RightArrow
Hear=JobTrail dot d b, actions
Hear=2026-09-08 First interview for Accessibility Analyst interview scheduled, 1 of 1

[step]

Say=Backspace comes back, as it goes up a level everywhere.
Key=Backspace
Hear=JobTrail dot d b, jobs
Hear=Example Widgets Company (sample employer) Accessibility Analyst interviewing, 2 of 4
Note=Alt plus Left Arrow does the same.

[step]

Say=Control plus M, Mark -- M for Mark.
Key=Control+M
Hear=Marked row 2

[step]

Say=Control plus Shift plus M unmarks. Adding Shift reverses.
Key=Control+Shift+M
Hear=Unmarked row 2
Note=Shift plus M, Say Mark, asks without changing anything.

[step]

Say=Control plus Down Arrow steps to the next marked record.
Key=Control+DownArrow
Hear=Sample Health Network (illustration only) Records Coordinator applied, 4 of 4

[step]

Say=Shift plus Space counts them.
Key=Shift+Space
Hear=2 marked rows: Example Widgets Company (sample employer), Sample Health Network (illustration only)

[step]

Say=For runs of rows: Edit, B for Bulk Marking, then A for Mark All.
Key=Control+A
Hear=Marked 4 rows
Note=Control plus A is the key for Mark All; Control plus Shift plus A unmarks all.

[step]

Say=Every table has two columns nobody types into. Shift plus L, Say Look.
Key=Shift+L
Hear=look, Example Widgets Company (sample employer) | Accessibility Analyst | interviewing
Note=Look is the record at a glance. It is what Say Related shows for a linked record.

[step]

Say=Shift plus P, Say Prime: the fields that make the record unique.
Key=Shift+P
Hear=prime, Example Widgets Company (sample employer)|Accessibility Analyst
Note=Employer and title. Two jobs with both the same would be one job.

[step]

Say=To tell a friend about a job: Control plus Shift plus C copies the record. C for Copy; Control plus C alone copies the cell.
Key=Control+Shift+C
Hear=Row copied to clipboard
Note=Labelled lines, ready to paste.

[step]

Say=For a prepared document: File, R for Run Report. Its key is Alt plus Shift plus R.
Key=Alt+Shift+R
Hear=Run Report dialog
Hear=Output list box, application underscore history, 1 of 6, ALT+O

[step]

Say=Enter opens the report in the editor.
Key=Enter
Hear=EdSharp, application underscore history dot m d

[step]

Say=My counselor asks what I did, when, with whom, and what came of it. The actions table holds exactly that.
Key=Shift+Z
Hear=status, actions row 1 of 7, sort action date descending

[step]

Say=Three fields matter to the agency: method, evidence, and counts -- whether it was an employer contact.
Key=Shift+C
Hear=method
Hear=row 1 of 7
Hear=internet

[step]

Say=File, R for Run Report.
Key=Alt+Shift+R
Hear=Run Report dialog
Hear=Output list box, application underscore history, 1 of 6, ALT+O

[step]

Say=Typing W jumps to the report I want. That is W, Whiskey.
Key=w
Hear=work underscore search underscore record, 6 of 6

[step]

Say=Enter runs it, and the editor opens with the result.
Key=Enter
Hear=EdSharp, work underscore search underscore record dot m d
Note=Countable contacts first, with weekly totals; everything else after.

[step]

Say=What this walk taught. I say the key; the reader says what it does.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Shift plus R.
Key=
Hear=Say Related

[step]

Say=Alt plus RightArrow.
Key=
Hear=Enter Child Table

[step]

Say=Control plus M.
Key=
Hear=Mark Record

[step]

Say=Control plus Shift plus M.
Key=
Hear=Unmark Record
